This is a placeholder for the demo package ZIP file.
In a real implementation, this would be a binary ZIP file containing:

1. demo-bundle.html - Standalone demo file
2. demo-production.html - Production-ready demo with analytics
3. README.md - Setup and usage instructions
4. industry-samples.json - Industry-specific sample data
5. demo-analytics.js - Analytics tracking implementation
6. demo-script.md - Customer demo script
7. video-walkthrough.md - Video production guidelines
8. assets/ - Images, icons, and other resources
9. docs/ - Technical documentation
10. examples/ - Integration examples for different frameworks

The ZIP file would be created programmatically and served for download.
